тIоргу<PRON><all>:тIоргуда  # весь, всё, все

PATTERN Determinative

DetStem [>:>] DetCl
DetStem [>:>] DetCl[m] [>:>] [<m.obl>:щу] [>:>] CaseCard
DetStem [>:>] DetClPl [>:>] [<pl.obl>:лу] [>:>] CaseCard
DetStem [>:>] DetCl[nm] [>:>] [<nm.obl>:лълъи] [>:>] CaseCard[erg]
